OL,3,GNEWSAEastbourne Pier evacuated as crews
OL,4,Atackle fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEastbourne Pier has been evacuated as
OL,7,Ffirefighters tackle a blaze that has
OL,8,Fbroken out at the landmark.
OL,10,FEast Sussex Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(ESFRS) said it was called to the pier
OL,12,Fat about 10:30 BST on Sunday and six
OL,13,Fcrews, including an aerial ladder
OL,14,Fplatform, were at the scene.
OL,16,FBoth the gas and electrics had been
OL,17,Fisolated by crews, the service added.
OL,19,FAt about 11:20, ESFRS said the fire had
OL,20,Fbeen extinguished and crews were
OL,21,Fdealing with hot spots.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
